# Vite 8 and jsdom 30 both need Node 22.19+. The three package.json files
# now declare `engines.node: ">=22.19"`, which is the load-bearing part: npm
# warns on a mismatch, and Vercel reads it to pick a matching runtime.
#
# engine-strict is deliberately left OFF. It turns that warning into a hard
# install failure, and `npm install` also runs inside Vercel's build, so
# enabling it would make a deploy break on a runtime version we do not control
# from here. Enable it per-machine, or on CI, once the pinned Node is
# guaranteed:
#
#   engine-strict=true
